MTD	title	EXAMPLE (fictitious data): Plasma lipidome of healthy adults and patients with type 2 diabetes: Plasma lipidome, RP-LC-MS/MS positive mode
MTD	description	Targeted plasma lipidomics of 40 adults (20 with type 2 diabetes, 20 controls), measured by RP-LC-MS/MS in positive and negative mode. 8 plasma samples (EXAMPLE), RP-LC-MS/MS on a Q Exactive in positive mode.
